{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"Eloise finds herself sitting at a wooden table with two cups of tea and a kettle, opposite an elderly dryad woman who smiles. \"How are you feeling, my dear?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T01:37:37.297000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879902304961179690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"I'm experiencing a lot... its a bit hard to process if I'm being honest so... that's a *really* big question...\" Eloise  laughs nervously  before reaching out to the tea cup, not drinking yet but seeking comfort in the familiarity.","created_at":"2021-08-25T01:40:21.593000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879902994068566097","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"She nods. \"We have much to discuss, but to begin with I'd like to ask about this\" she gestures to your form. \"I hear you aren't feeling like yourself.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T01:41:53.649000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879903380179398707","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"Eloise shakes her head. \"Not quite... I still feel like *me* but not *me*... Oh how to explain it... I... hmmm... This *was* me, not a me I liked... I hated this me back then... I don't feel that hate now, I don't want to stay this way either... its wierd... Sorry.  I'm rambling and not making sense...\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T01:46:57.780000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879904655797280818","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"She nods. \"I understand. You've cone to be at peace with that past self so it serves as some sort of refuge when you're current self has fallen into... less than ideal circumstances. Nevertheless, this is not a way you'd wish to stay?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T01:51:14.751000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879905733611769887","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"Eloise thinks for a moment. \"At peace is a good way to put it... I would rather be Eliot though. *This* Eloise is nice, but its not me... That came out bad.. its me either way...\" Eloise begins to ramble, although mostly to herself.","created_at":"2021-08-25T01:58:31.066000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879907563649507368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"Gaillardia nods. \"I know it may seem difficult, but you can just be Eliot. You are the one in control of yourself, your spirit.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:03:31.958000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879908825682042971","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"Eloise nods thoughtfully then shakes her head.  \"No... I can't. Not yet. Soon though.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:06:57.477000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879909687691202580","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"very well.\" Gaillardia says, sipping her tea. \"Is there anything else you wish to discuss before we begin negotiations?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:09:14.521000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879910262495391744","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"I... I don't want to pry.. but I didn't want to be rude either... but... no... Ill ask him when I see him... Sorry... Like I said there's just so much...\" Eloise takes a moment to take a deep breath to center herself, locks eyes with Gaillardia then nods.","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:15:27.650000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879911827511844914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"please, ask away my dear. I don't want you coming back with any regrets.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:16:11.311000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879912010639376424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"Its about Mister Demetrius, and probably better if I ask him himself. I'm just worried, that's all.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:17:44.861000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879912403016503337","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"She nods. \"Very well. Now then, Demetrius has convinced me to go easy on you, which I think is fair, all things considered. That said, what would you be willing to offer?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:23:26.750000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879913837002911775","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"Eloise take a moment to think, her expression stern while looking at Gaillardia, but then she suddenly starts laughing and looks away.","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:29:35.320000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879915382897541212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"Gaillardia looks confused. \"Are you alright?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:32:33.928000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879916132033761331","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"I'm fine. I'm fine. I'm fine.\" Eloise repeats through a fit of laughter before calming down. \"I just had a *really* silly thought of what to offer.\" She starts trying to center herself  again. \"A ghost trying to come back to life, and tries to offer thier mortality...\" She says softly shaking her head, a smile on her face.","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:35:53.151000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879916967635611680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"I'm not sure exactly what you mean by that.\" Gaillardia chuckles. \"Mortality isn't typically considered a price to lose.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:39:05.523000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879917774502248488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"You're right. Its not. Typically I mean. There's times, people,  where it could work, I'm not one of them. I was just wracking my head as to what I *can* offer. I owe so much to Mister Demetrius already... and the only other thing I can think of right now... isn't much of a price to lose either...\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:45:52.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879919479428108329","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"oh?\" Gaillardia asks, sipping tea","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:49:58.597000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879920513693130792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"My dream...\" Eloise says softly. \"The one thing I've worked my whole life for. The place I've always seen as my safe place. My home. My cafè....\" Eloise's eyes begin to tear up. \"I love the place so much. My pride. My joy. So many hours. Blood. Sweat. Tears...\" The tears slowly slide down her cheeks. \"But I'm not certain I could go back there now... not after what happened... not like I used to...\" She wipes the tears away as she sniffles \" 'Sides, I don't even think it's mine to offer. I haven't finished paying it off yet.\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T02:59:54.206000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879923011858341950","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"Gaillardia shakes her head. \"I wouldn't let you give that up, even if you could. As for what you can give, I can take memories, magical abilities, your ability to connect to magical objects, certain methods of speech....\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T03:08:12.470000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879925101729038397","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"My cooking?\" Eloise asks coldly, not a malicious cold, but the coldness of defeat.","created_at":"2021-08-25T03:13:22.320000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879926401334136882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"Gaillardia shakes her head once more. \"I wouldn't accept it. I know for a fact there are things you can offer that won't interfere with your dream. How about your ability to connect with magical items (one attunement slot)?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T03:14:57.972000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879926802527699005","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
