{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"879698332434460672","content":"\"I will.\" Eloise gives a firm nod. \"As much as I like your tea, and you seem amazing, but... what more do I need to do?\"","created_at":"2021-08-25T03:32:58.326000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879931333860786216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
